# Files present in the build output that must NOT be uploaded to Cloudflare as
# public static assets. Same syntax as .gitignore.
#
# Source maps only. Stage 5C-1A approved excluding them from the initial
# Technical Preview: they are ~72% of the build and no user requests them. This
# is a TRANSFER decision, not a security one — the repository is public and the
# build is reproducible, so a map for any released commit can be regenerated
# locally. Excluding them here leaves `sourcemap: true` and local debugging
# untouched, and does not alter a single runtime asset byte.
*.map

# _headers is deliberately NOT listed. Wrangler must still read it as static
# asset configuration; excluding it would silently drop the cross-origin
# isolation contract.
